int CGame::_iCalcMaxLoad(int iClientH)\par
Remplazamos toda la funcion por:\par
\par
int CGame::_iCalcMaxLoad(int iClientH)\par
\{ if (m_pClientList[iClientH] == NULL) return 0; return ((m_pClientList[iClientH]->m_iStr * 500 + m_pClientList[iClientH]->m_iLevel*500) *2);\par
\}\par
